  "longBusinessSummary": "HPL Electric & Power Limited manufactures and sells electric equipment under the HPL brand in India and internationally. The company operates through two segments: Metering, Systems & Services and Consumer, Industrial & Services. It offers digital panel and energy, multi-function, load managers, demand controllers, power quality, projection, dual source energy, HTCT, and keypad based prepaid energy meters; power factor control and regulator; meter cover boxes; and data acquisition and billing solutions. The company also provides edeno, smarts, tuff modular switches; LED lighting products, including bulbs, tube lights, panel lights, downlights, spotlights, strip, street lights, floodlights, and decorative lights, as well as boilers and petrol pump, high bay, box type LED, weatherproof, and well glass lights; and smarter accessories, such as angle and batten holder, multi plug, ceiling rose, plug top, extension cord, power strip and spike guards, door bells, O-protect, and DP switches, as well as sockets and support modules. It offers air circuit breakers, MCCB products, automatic transfer switches, changeover switches, control and fuse gears, motor starters, isolators, SFU and offload changeover, panels and enclosures, visual cutoff switch, and fuses and fuse base; and MCB, RCCB, RCBO, MCB changeover, ACCL 1 phase and 3 phase, and distribution boards. The company provides domestic and industrial wires; specialty cables, including data networking, CCTV, fire alarm, low induction, instrumentation, and hybrid cables; power cables such as multi core telephone, networking, and fire survival; and control cables, such as submersible and ZHFR. It offers ceiling, portable, ventilation, and farata fans; and solar products. The company serves institutional, commercial, industrial, and residential customers; power utilities; and government agencies through dealers and distributors. It also exports its products. The company was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Sonipat, India.",
